   175	    diff_interval_report applies verify_position_for_store to BOTH
   176	    positions before any rowid is compared — the same guard every ``at=``
   177	    read selector uses. An unadopted or lineage-foreign position refuses;
   178	    a same-lineage position from another store RE-RESOLVES to this store's
   179	    rowid, which is the behavior upgrade: a cross-replica diff is answered
   180	    correctly instead of silently indexing an unrelated prefix.
